  "system": {
    "identifier": "superior-assault",
    "description": "<p>Beginning at 3rd Level you learn maneuvers that capitalize on your ability to lay down aggressive tactics and strategies snatching victory from your foes through sheer skill alone which are fueled by your Superiority Die.</p>\n<p>You learn two maneuvers of your choice, which are detailed in the Assault Maneuvers Section at the end of this class. You earn more at higher levels as shown in the Maneuvers Known Column of the Scout-Nin Class table. Maneuvers normally enhance your unarmed or Weapon attacks or jutsu you cast in some way. You can use one maneuver per turn as part of an unarmed or weapon attack made with the Attack Action or as part of a Bonus Action attack or as part of a jutsu’s casting. Otherwise, a maneuver will detail its Action economy cost.</p>\n<p>As part of your superior skill to lay down oppressive force, you gain a +1 bonus to your critical threat range with attacks made using your Primary casting discipline.</p>",
